#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_MonsReluctantToUseDislikedMoves"
msgid ""
"If it doesn't like a certain move,\n"
"a POKéMON will be reluctant to use it.\p"
"It doesn't matter how strong it is,\n"
"either.\p"
"For example, a POKéMON with a GENTLE\n"
"nature probably won't enjoy hurting\l"
"its opponents.\p"
"If it can't seem to live up to its\n"
"potential, it's probably failing at\l"
"using a disliked move against its will.$"
msgstr ""
"如果宝可梦不喜欢某个招式，\n"
"它就会不太情愿使用。\p"
"不管它有多强都一样。\p"
"比如说，温顺性格的宝可梦\n"
"大概不会喜欢伤害对手吧。\p"
"如果它好像没能发挥出\n"
"应有的实力，可能就是被迫\l"
"使用了不喜欢的招式而失败了。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:338
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_GentleMonsScaryIfAngry"
msgid ""
"My big sister is gentle usually.\n"
"But when she gets angry,\l"
"she's really, really scary!\p"
"I bet a gentle POKéMON will be scary\n"
"if it gets angry!$"
msgstr ""
"我姐姐平时很温柔。\n"
"可是她一生气，\l"
"就会变得非常非常可怕！\p"
"我猜温顺的宝可梦\n"
"生起气来也一定很可怕！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AttractionRunsDeep"
msgid ""
"My feelings toward my POKéMON…\n"
"The attraction runs deep…\p"
"Oh, hi, you didn't see that, did you?\n"
"Well, it doesn't matter.\p"
"How would you like this TM for\n"
"your POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"我对我的宝可梦的感情……\n"
"真是深深的爱慕啊……\p"
"哦，你好，你没看到吧？\n"
"算了，没关系。\p"
"这个招式学习器\n"
"给你的宝可梦用怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_AttractionMutual"
msgid ""
"My feelings toward my POKéMON…\n"
"I'm sure the attraction is mutual!\p"
"They battle exactly the way I want\n"
"them to!$"
msgstr ""
"我对我的宝可梦的感情……\n"
"我相信我们一定是两情相悦！\p"
"它们完全按照我的想法\n"
"在对战！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_TaughtWhatKindsOfMoves"
msgid ""
"What kind of moves have you taught\n"
"your POKéMON?\p"
"I think you would give yourself\n"
"an advantage if they knew how to\l"
"heal or protect themselves.$"
msgstr ""
"你教了你的宝可梦\n"
"什么样的招式？\p"
"我觉得如果它们会回复\n"
"或保护自己的招式，\l"
"对你会比较有利。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ScottCanMeetToughTrainers"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hey there, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I thought I might see you here.\p"
"A BATTLE TENT's a place where\n"
"you can meet tough TRAINERS.\p"
"It doesn't matter what the rules are,\n"
"or how battles are waged, either.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I expect you to do\n"
"the best you can!$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：嘿，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我就猜会在这里见到你。\p"
"对战帐篷是个能遇到\n"
"强大训练家的地方。\p"
"不管规则是什么，\n"
"也不管对战的方式如何。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，我期待你\n"
"能拿出全部的实力！$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:376
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_BattleTentLobby_Text_ScottVisitRegularly"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: I visit here regularly in hopes\n"
"of seeing tough TRAINERS in action\l"
"in whatever the situation.$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：我经常来这里，\n"
"希望能看到强大的训练家\l"
"在各种情况下的表现。$"
